<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Getting Started on</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/</link><description>Recent content in Getting Started on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Prerequisites</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/prerequisites/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/prerequisites/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="requirements"&gt;Requirements&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#requirements" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Windows, Linux, or macOS (amd64 or arm64)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://scala-cli.virtuslab.org/"&gt;Scala CLI&lt;/a&gt;, required to run automod&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com"&gt;VSCode&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href="https://vscodium.com"&gt;VSCodium&lt;/a&gt; (optional, but highly recommended)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/"&gt;TypeScript&lt;/a&gt; (optional, only if you want to use TypeScript patchlets)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/install/"&gt;.NET Runtime 10&lt;/a&gt; (optional — Windows only if you use &lt;a href="https://github.com/4sval/FModel"&gt;FModel&lt;/a&gt; to browse/extract assets; any platform if you regenerate Unity &lt;code&gt;ttmap&lt;/code&gt; schemas with &lt;code&gt;.ttmapgen&lt;/code&gt;, which drives the &lt;code&gt;ttmapgen&lt;/code&gt; C# harness; automod auto-downloads &lt;code&gt;ttmapgen.jar&lt;/code&gt; otherwise)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link disabled"&#10; id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"&#10; aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; Installing dependencies:&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="windows" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="true"&gt;&#10; Windows&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="linux" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; Linux&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-03-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-03" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="macos" aria-controls="tabs-00-03" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; macOS&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-01-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-cmd" data-lang="cmd"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;winget install virtuslab.scalacli &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;winget install Microsoft.DotNet.DesktopRuntime.10 &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: only if you want to use FModel&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;winget install OpenJS.NodeJS &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;npm install -g typescript &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;winget install vscodium &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: or, winget install Microsoft.VisualStudioCode&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-02" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-02-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -sSLf https://scala-cli.virtuslab.org/get &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -o- https://fnm.vercel.app/install &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;fnm install &lt;span class="m"&gt;24&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;npm install -g typescript &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# If snap is available, otherwise download from https://vscodium.com or https://code.visualstudio.com&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;snap install codium --classic &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or, sudo snap install code --classic&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-03" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-03-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -sSLf https://scala-cli.virtuslab.org/get &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -o- https://fnm.vercel.app/install &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;fnm install &lt;span class="m"&gt;24&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;npm install -g typescript &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# if you want to use TypeScript patchlets&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;brew install vscodium &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or, brew install --cask visual-studio-code&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="managed-tools"&gt;Managed Tools&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#managed-tools" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;These utility/modding tools will be &lt;em&gt;automatically&lt;/em&gt; downloaded by automod when it is first launched:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Setup</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/setup/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/setup/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://i.imgur.com/QAH8ArP.gif" alt="automod-demo"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link disabled"&#10; id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"&#10; aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; Setting up and running automod:&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="windows" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="true"&gt;&#10; Windows&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="macos/linux" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; macOS/Linux&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-01-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-cmd" data-lang="cmd"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -JLo automod.zip https://codeload.github.com/jpabscale/automod/legacy.zip/master&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar xf automod.zip&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;move&lt;/span&gt; jpabscale-automod-* automod&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;del&lt;/span&gt; automod.zip&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; automod &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: change to uncompressed directory if downloaded as a zip file&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;automod .demo.sb &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: generate Stellar Blade demonstration mods&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;automod .demo.soa &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: generate Sands of Aura demonstration mod&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;automod .setup.vscode &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; :: or, automod .setup&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-02" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-02-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -JLo automod.tar.gz https://codeload.github.com/jpabscale/automod/legacy.tar.gz/master&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar xf automod.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mv jpabscale-automod* automod&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;rm automod.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; automod &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# change to uncompressed directory if downloaded as a zip file&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./automod .demo.sb &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# generate Stellar Blade demonstration mods&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./automod .demo.soa &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# generate Sands of Aura demonstration mod&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./automod .setup.vscode &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or, ./automod .setup&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;As it generates a mod (e.g., &lt;code&gt;.demo.sb&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;.demo.soa&lt;/code&gt;), automod uses &lt;a href="https://github.com/jpabscale/zenpak4j"&gt;zenpak4j&lt;/a&gt; (the JVM port of retoc and repak) to extract legacy &lt;code&gt;.uasset&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;.uexp&lt;/code&gt; files, converts them to &lt;a href="https://github.com/atenfyr/UAssetAPI"&gt;UAssetAPI&lt;/a&gt; &lt;code&gt;.json&lt;/code&gt; format in-process using uasset4j (the JVM port of UAssetAPI), programmatically patches the &lt;code&gt;.json&lt;/code&gt; file, converts the patched &lt;code&gt;.json&lt;/code&gt; file back to &lt;code&gt;.uasset&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;.uexp&lt;/code&gt; in-process using uasset4j, and then to &lt;code&gt;.utoc&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;.ucas&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;.pak&lt;/code&gt; using zenpak4j.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Command Line Interface (CLI)</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/cli/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/cli/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link disabled"&#10; id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"&#10; aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; Displaying CLI usage:&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="windows" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="true"&gt;&#10; Windows&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="macos/linux" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; macOS/Linux&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"&#10; id="tabs-00-01" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-01-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-cmd" data-lang="cmd"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;automod&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-02" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-02-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./automod&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Auto Modding Script v4.1.0&#10;&#10;Usage: automod [-s] opt* [ &amp;lt;mod-name&amp;gt; option*&#10; | .batch option*&#10; | .demo.[sb|soa]&#10; | .diff[.into] &amp;lt;from-path&amp;gt; &amp;lt;to-path&amp;gt; &amp;lt;out-path&amp;gt;&#10; | .search[.flat] &amp;lt;paths-input&amp;gt;.sam &amp;lt;out-path&amp;gt;&#10; | .setup[.vscode [ &amp;lt;path-to-vscode&amp;gt; ]]&#10; | .toml[.all] &amp;lt;out-path&amp;gt;&#10; | .ttmapgen &amp;lt;args...&amp;gt;&#10; | .upgrade&#10; ]&#10;&#10; -s Disable Scala CLI server&#10;&#10;opt:&#10; -g &amp;lt;game-id&amp;gt; Active game identifier (default: SB)&#10; -l &amp;lt;num&amp;gt; Maximum task logs to keep (default: 30)&#10; -p Disable parallelization&#10; --pak Force legacy .pak output even for zen games&#10; -c &amp;lt;license-path&amp;gt; Include license file(s) in the generated mod&#10;&#10;option:&#10; --dry-run Disable actual mod generation and just test patches&#10; --include-patches Include patches in the generated mod&#10; --no-code-patching Disable code patching&#10; --ultra-compression Use 7z ultra compression&#10;&#10;.batch [mod...] Generate a mod for each sub-folder in patches/&amp;lt;game-id&amp;gt;, or only the&#10; named mod(s) (e.g. `.batch eve-raven raven-sword`)&#10;.demo.sb Generate all Stellar Blade demonstration mods&#10;.demo.soa Generate Sands of Aura demonstration mod&#10;.diff Recursively diff JSON files and write jd and TOML patch files&#10;.diff.into Use .diff between &amp;lt;from-path&amp;gt; with each sub-folder of &amp;lt;to-path&amp;gt;&#10;.search Query UAssetAPI JSON files using the JSONPaths in &amp;lt;paths-input&amp;gt;&#10;.search.flat Same as .search but without resolved paths in a single array result&#10;.setup Only set up modding tools&#10;.setup.vscode Set up modding tools and VSCode extensions&#10;.toml Merge existing patch files in patches as TOML patch files&#10;.toml.all Merge script code patches with patch files in patches as TOML&#10;.ttmapgen &amp;lt;args...&amp;gt; Run the asset4j ttmapgen CLI (ttmap generator)&#10;.upgrade Upgrade automod to the latest version&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Disabling the Scala CLI server (&lt;code&gt;-s&lt;/code&gt;) reduces the number of dependencies that Scala CLI downloads, thus saving bandwidth. However, it will be slower to use because of the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) cold boot time.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>VSCode Extension</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/vscode/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/vscode/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://i.imgur.com/jUSkGbC.gif" alt="automod-vscode"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="settings"&gt;Settings&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#settings" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Open settings using the &lt;strong&gt;File&lt;/strong&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferences&lt;/strong&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;strong&gt;Settings&lt;/strong&gt; menu item (or the &lt;code&gt;Ctrl + ,&lt;/code&gt; keyboard shortcut) and search for: automod.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Most settings are populated, but you can fill in your mod name and game information. Note that &lt;strong&gt;Game Active ID&lt;/strong&gt; is the game folder name containing &lt;code&gt;Content\Paks&lt;/code&gt;, and it defaults to &lt;strong&gt;SB&lt;/strong&gt; if left blank (but it is a good practice to fill it in regardless).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;You can also edit the settings by accessing the command palette (&lt;code&gt;Ctrl + Shift + P&lt;/code&gt;) and running &lt;strong&gt;Preferences: Open User Settings (JSON)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>